    <abstract>
        <para>The dataset consists of records of mammalian species in Ukraine published in Proceedings of the First Ukrainian Mammal Mapping Conference: Mammals on map of Ukraine. Materials of the First Ukrainian Mammal Mapping Conference, Kyiv, Kyiv Zoo, 28–29 March 2019 / M.Yu. Rusin &amp;amp; M.A. Ghazali (eds.). Kyiv, 2019. ― 237 pp.
Created under the framework of program European Mammals on Maps. The materials would be interesting for professional zoologists and for those interested in creation of atlases of biodiversity.</para>
    </abstract>
